# PEM armor names (OpenSSL PEM_read_bio_* headers). DER structure cannot be
# mutated into existence, so seeds carry it; these tokens only help the PEM
# path. All multi-byte and traceable to OpenSSL PEM names.
"-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----"
"-----END CERTIFICATE-----"
"-----BEGIN X509 CRL-----"
"-----END X509 CRL-----"
"-----BEGIN TRUSTED CERTIFICATE-----"
"-----END TRUSTED CERTIFICATE-----"
